              "heading": "Short Title of 2012 Amendment",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "p",
                  "text": "Pub. L. 112–142, § 1, July 9, 2012, 126 Stat. 989, provided that this Act may be cited as the \"Church Plan Investment Clarification Act\"."
                }
